&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a Senior Field Service Engineer, you will play a crucial role in ensuring our customers’ satisfaction and success. Your daily work will be divided between tasks at our headquarters in Munich, our production facility in Kaufbeuren, and, above all, on-site at customer locations. Your work will focus specifically on products in the mobile robotics sector and will include commissioning, troubleshooting, and conducting workshops at the customer’s site.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide direct technical support to our global customers regarding the product portfolio of Franka Robotics GmbH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and troubleshoot issues via the ticket system, remote support, or directly on-site at the customer’s location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct commissioning, repair visits, and customer workshops both on-site and in-house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface between Customer Support, Development, Sales, and Product Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge transfer and stakeholder to our international partners and subsidiaries regarding the aforementioned product portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalation management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
